# SIP Interactive Verification Plan

- [ ] Open http://localhost:3000/investments.
- [ ] Log in using "user@example.com" and "password123" if redirected to login.
- [ ] Scroll to "Investment Reminder Alerts" section at the bottom.
- [ ] Verify that a dynamic alert with "Auto" badge shows SIP is "Overdue (Date Crossed)".
- [ ] Click the ListFilter icon button on that alert to open the "Manage SIP Plan" modal.
- [ ] Locate "Next Cycle Rollover" box and the button "Confirm Payment & Advance Month".
- [ ] Click "Confirm Payment & Advance Month".
- [ ] Observe "Next Auto-Debit Date" rolls over to the next month.
- [ ] Click "Done" to close the modal.
- [ ] Scroll back to "Investment Reminder Alerts".
- [ ] Verify if the overdue alert has disappeared or changed to a future countdown.
- [ ] Return success report.
